---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+17035550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(703) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Damaged Downspouts Woodbridge, VA | Replace & Extend" description="Crushed or disconnected downspouts in Woodbridge? Fast replacement and proper discharge. Call (703) 555-0199.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> → Problems → Damaged Downspouts</div>
      <h1>Damaged Downspouts in Woodbridge</h1>
      <p>Crushed, disconnected, or missing downspouts dump water at the foundation. Fast replacement protects your home.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <p>We replace damaged sections, add extensions, and ensure water is discharged a safe distance from the foundation and landscaping.</p>
      <div style="margin-top:2rem;text-align:center"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call {phoneDisplay}</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
